## Human intervention needed

The automated job failed while generating tests for `org.apache.sshd:sshd-core:2.18.0`.

Preserved work: https://github.com/oracle/graalvm-reachability-metadata/tree/ai%2Fkimeta%2Fhuman-intervention%2Fissue-9958-library-new-request-org.apache.sshd-sshd-core-2.18.0-fdf437ad

The persistent blocker is `nativeTestCompile`: Native Image reports that `org.apache.sshd.common.file.root.RootedFileSystemProvider` is stored in the image heap while runtime-initialized. This occurs even with only the scaffold placeholder test, indicating a classpath/service-provider initialization problem rather than a particular generated test. Six later Gradle runs reproduce it. A transient JVM failure parsing `PT10S` occurred earlier but was not the terminal blocker.

After 12 iterations, metrics recorded the same starting and ending commit, `0` generated LOC, `0` metadata entries, and unavailable dynamic-access coverage. The preserved test remains a placeholder and the metadata file is empty.

Inspect:
